# Project Architecture

## Stack (locked)

- Vite + React + TypeScript + React Router + Tailwind CSS
- Never introduce Next.js, Remix, or another meta-framework unless the user explicitly requests it
- Custom Tailwind only — no shadcn, MUI, Ant Design, or Chakra unless explicitly requested

## Scope

- Build **role by role**. Current phase: **Super Admin only**
- Do not scaffold General Admin / HOD / Staff / Vendor / Customer portals early
- Phase 1 is UI + mock data; keep call sites API-ready via helpers

## Folder layout

```
src/
  api/           # axios client, helpers, endpoints
  mocks/         # fixtures + mock handlers
  auth/          # AuthContext, guards
  layouts/       # Admin shell, sidebar, topbar
  pages/         # route-level screens (by role)
  components/ui/ # shared primitives only
  types/         # shared domain types
  styles/        # theme tokens / global CSS
```

- Pages stay thin: UI + hooks. Business/API access goes through `src/api/`.
- Shared visuals live in `components/ui/`. Do not duplicate Button/Input/Table per page.
- Locale defaults: INR and India-oriented labels (GST, etc.) unless told otherwise.
